## Why This Is Asked
This question probes real‑world bridging, multi‑threading, and performance diagnostics in React Native. It requires designing a low‑overhead data path, handling backpressure, and considering user privacy and lifecycle cleanup.

## Key Concepts
- Native module threading (UI thread, background sampling thread)
- Per‑frame telemetry data model (input, layout, paint, GPU timestamps)
